{"seq":3,"slug":"stellar-evolution-tracks","title":"恒星演化轨迹：赫罗图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/stellar-evolution-tracks","wordCount":2742,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"恒星演化轨迹-赫罗图\">恒星演化轨迹：赫罗图</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本文以赫罗图为主线，围绕以下核心概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>赫罗图（HR图）</strong>：以光度（或绝对星等）为纵轴、有效温度为横轴，是刻画恒星演化轨迹的通用坐标系；恒星的集中分布（主序、巨星支、超巨星区、白矮星序列）反映了各阶段停留时间的差异</li>\n<li><strong>主序与质量-光度关系</strong>：ZAMS 位置由质量唯一决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3.5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/L_\\odot\\approx(M/M_\\odot)^{3.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，由此推出主序寿命 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{MS}\\propto M^{-2.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>ZAMS → TAMS 的内演化</strong>：核心 H→He 使平均分子量增大，恒星缓慢增亮左移（暗弱太阳问题的根源）</li>\n<li><strong>红巨星支与氦闪</strong>：Schönberg-Chandrasekhar 极限触发氦核收缩，低质量恒星的简并氦核以热失控的氦闪点燃</li>\n<li><strong>多阶段核燃烧与终态</strong>：AGB 双壳源、行星状星云、大质量恒星的多阶段燃烧与蓝/红超巨星往复，最终按初始质量分岔为中子星或黑洞</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"赫罗图的基本概念\">赫罗图的基本概念</h2><p>赫罗图（Hertzsprung-Russell Diagram, HR图）是恒星天文学中最重要的工具之一，以恒星的<strong>光度</strong>（或绝对星等）为纵轴、<strong>有效温度</strong>（或光谱型/色指数）为横轴绘制。每一颗恒星在HR图上占据一个位置，其一生的演化轨迹在图上描绘出特征曲线。</p>\n<p>HR图的关键特征在于：恒星并非均匀分布，而是集中在若干特定区域——<strong>主序</strong>、<strong>巨星支</strong>、<strong>超巨星区</strong>、<strong>白矮星区</strong>等。这种非均匀分布反映了恒星在不同演化阶段停留时间的差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hr图的主要区域\">HR图的主要区域</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[赫罗图主要区域] --&gt; B[主序带&lt;br/&gt;氢核心燃烧&lt;br/&gt;停留时间最长]&#10;    A --&gt; C[红巨星支&lt;br/&gt;氢壳燃烧&lt;br/&gt;氦核心收缩]&#10;    A --&gt; D[水平支&lt;br/&gt;氦核心燃烧&lt;br/&gt;3α过程]&#10;    A --&gt; E[渐近巨星支 AGB&lt;br/&gt;双壳燃烧&lt;br/&gt;热脉冲]&#10;    A --&gt; F[超巨星区&lt;br/&gt;大质量恒星&lt;br/&gt;多阶段核燃烧]&#10;    A --&gt; G[白矮星序列&lt;br/&gt;冷却序列&lt;br/&gt;无核反应]&#10;    B --&gt; H[零龄主序 ZAMS]&#10;    B --&gt; I[终龄主序 TAMS]\">graph TD\n    A[赫罗图主要区域] --&gt; B[主序带&lt;br/&gt;氢核心燃烧&lt;br/&gt;停留时间最长]\n    A --&gt; C[红巨星支&lt;br/&gt;氢壳燃烧&lt;br/&gt;氦核心收缩]\n    A --&gt; D[水平支&lt;br/&gt;氦核心燃烧&lt;br/&gt;3α过程]\n    A --&gt; E[渐近巨星支 AGB&lt;br/&gt;双壳燃烧&lt;br/&gt;热脉冲]\n    A --&gt; F[超巨星区&lt;br/&gt;大质量恒星&lt;br/&gt;多阶段核燃烧]\n    A --&gt; G[白矮星序列&lt;br/&gt;冷却序列&lt;br/&gt;无核反应]\n    B --&gt; H[零龄主序 ZAMS]\n    B --&gt; I[终龄主序 TAMS]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>光度范围</th>\n<th>温度范围</th>\n<th>演化阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主序带</td>\n<td>10⁻⁴–10⁶ L☉</td>\n<td>2500–50000 K</td>\n<td>核心氢燃烧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红巨星支（RGB）</td>\n<td>10²–10⁴ L☉</td>\n<td>3000–5000 K</td>\n<td>氢壳燃烧 + 简并He核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水平支（HB）</td>\n<td>~50 L☉</td>\n<td>5000–25000 K</td>\n<td>核心氦燃烧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐近巨星支（AGB）</td>\n<td>10³–10⁵ L☉</td>\n<td>2500–4000 K</td>\n<td>双壳源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白矮星序列</td>\n<td>10⁻⁴–10⁻¹ L☉</td>\n<td>4000–100000 K</td>\n<td>热冷却</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主序阶段-核心氢燃烧\">主序阶段：核心氢燃烧</h2><h3 id=\"零龄主序-zams\">零龄主序（ZAMS）</h3><p>当一颗原恒星完成引力收缩、核心温度达到氢点燃温度（~10⁷ K）时，它到达<strong>零龄主序</strong>（Zero-Age Main Sequence）。ZAMS是恒星生命的正式起点。</p>\n<p>ZAMS上的位置完全由恒星质量决定（Vogt-Russell定理）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大质量恒星：高温、高光度、偏蓝 → 位于ZAMS左上方</li>\n<li>低质量恒星：低温、低光度、偏红 → 位于ZAMS右下方</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主序质量-光度关系的近似表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3.5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{L}{L_\\odot} \\approx \\left(\\frac{M}{M_\\odot}\\right)^{3.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2547em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"主序寿命\">主序寿命</h3><p>主序寿命取决于可用核燃料（∝M）与消耗速率（∝L）之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mtext> yr</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mtext> yr</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{MS} \\approx \\frac{M/M_\\odot}{L/L_\\odot} \\times 10^{10} \\text{ yr} \\approx \\left(\\frac{M}{M_\\odot}\\right)^{-2.5} \\times 10^{10} \\text{ yr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6331em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> yr</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> yr</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光谱型</th>\n<th>质量 (M☉)</th>\n<th>主序寿命</th>\n<th>表面温度 (K)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>O5</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>~3 × 10⁶ yr</td>\n<td>44000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B0</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>~1.1 × 10⁷ yr</td>\n<td>30000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A0</td>\n<td>3.2</td>\n<td>~3.7 × 10⁸ yr</td>\n<td>9800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G2（太阳）</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>~1.0 × 10¹⁰ yr</td>\n<td>5800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K5</td>\n<td>0.7</td>\n<td>~2.4 × 10¹⁰ yr</td>\n<td>4400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M5</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>~5 × 10¹¹ yr</td>\n<td>3200</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"主序内演化\">主序内演化</h3><p>恒星在主序阶段并非静止不变。随着核心氢逐渐消耗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>核心平均分子量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 增大（H → He）</li>\n<li>为维持压力平衡，核心温度和密度缓慢上升</li>\n<li>光度逐渐增大，恒星在HR图上缓慢向左上偏移</li>\n<li>太阳在45亿年间光度已增加约30%（暗弱太阳问题）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"离开主序-亚巨星支与红巨星支\">离开主序：亚巨星支与红巨星支</h2><h3 id=\"薛恩贝格-钱德拉塞卡极限\">薛恩贝格-钱德拉塞卡极限</h3><p>当核心氢耗尽，惰性氦核心形成。氦核心的质量不能超过恒星总质量的约10–15%（Schönberg-Chandrasekhar极限），否则等温核心无法维持流体静力平衡，将发生快速引力收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mi>M</mi></mfrac><mo>≲</mo><mn>0.37</mn><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{M_{core}}{M} \\lesssim 0.37 \\left(\\frac{\\mu_{env}}{\\mu_{core}}\\right)^2 \\approx 0.10 - 0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.37</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"红巨星支攀升\">红巨星支攀升</h3><p>核心收缩释放引力能，加热周围氢壳，壳层氢燃烧启动。外包层因能量注入而膨胀冷却，恒星向HR图右方（低温方向）移动，进入<strong>红巨星支</strong>（RGB）。</p>\n<p>RGB攀升的物理特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外包层深度对流（第一次挖掘 First Dredge-up）</li>\n<li>核心持续收缩、温度升高、简并度增加</li>\n<li>光度主要由氢壳源决定，与核心质量正相关</li>\n<li>RGB尖端光度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log(L/L_\\odot) \\approx 3.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.4</span></span></span></span></span>（低质量恒星）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[主序&lt;br/&gt;核心H燃烧] --&gt;|H耗尽| B[亚巨星支&lt;br/&gt;核心收缩&lt;br/&gt;壳层H点燃]&#10;    B --&gt;|包层膨胀| C[红巨星支&lt;br/&gt;壳层H燃烧&lt;br/&gt;简并He核]&#10;    C --&gt;|He点燃| D{M &gt; 2 M☉?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[非简并He点燃&lt;br/&gt;平稳过渡]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[氦闪&lt;br/&gt;简并核内&lt;br/&gt;热失控]&#10;    E --&gt; G[水平支&lt;br/&gt;核心He燃烧]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[主序&lt;br/&gt;核心H燃烧] --&gt;|H耗尽| B[亚巨星支&lt;br/&gt;核心收缩&lt;br/&gt;壳层H点燃]\n    B --&gt;|包层膨胀| C[红巨星支&lt;br/&gt;壳层H燃烧&lt;br/&gt;简并He核]\n    C --&gt;|He点燃| D{M &gt; 2 M☉?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[非简并He点燃&lt;br/&gt;平稳过渡]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[氦闪&lt;br/&gt;简并核内&lt;br/&gt;热失控]\n    E --&gt; G[水平支&lt;br/&gt;核心He燃烧]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"氦燃烧阶段\">氦燃烧阶段</h2><h3 id=\"氦闪-helium-flash\">氦闪（Helium Flash）</h3><p>对于低质量恒星（M &lt; 2 M☉），氦核心在RGB顶部已变为电子简并态。当核心温度达到 ~10⁸ K 时，3α反应点燃。由于简并物质的压力不依赖温度，温度升高不会导致膨胀来自调节反应速率——形成<strong>热失控</strong>。在极短时间内（数秒），氦闪释放约 10¹¹ L☉ 的能量（全部被外层吸收），直到温度足够高解除简并。</p>\n<h3 id=\"水平支-horizontal-branch\">水平支（Horizontal Branch）</h3><p>氦闪后（或大质量恒星的平稳点燃），恒星进入稳定的核心氦燃烧阶段。在HR图上，这些恒星分布在水平支上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光度相近（~50 L☉）</li>\n<li>温度由包层质量决定：包层厚 → 红端（红丛），包层薄 → 蓝端</li>\n<li>球状星团中水平支形态是重要的恒星族群诊断工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"渐近巨星支-agb\">渐近巨星支（AGB）</h2><p>核心氦耗尽后，惰性碳-氧核心外围形成氦壳和氢壳的双壳源结构。恒星再次膨胀冷却，在HR图上攀升至<strong>渐近巨星支</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"agb阶段的关键物理\">AGB阶段的关键物理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>观测后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热脉冲（Thermal Pulse）</td>\n<td>He壳间歇性热失控点燃</td>\n<td>光度周期性变化（10³–10⁵ yr周期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三次挖掘</td>\n<td>对流将He壳燃烧产物带至表面</td>\n<td>表面碳增丰 → 碳星形成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级风（Superwind）</td>\n<td>辐射压驱动尘粒加速气体</td>\n<td>质量损失率 10⁻⁵–10⁻⁴ M☉/yr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mira变星脉动</td>\n<td>κ机制驱动径向脉动</td>\n<td>光变幅 &gt; 2.5 mag，周期100–1000天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>s-过程核合成</td>\n<td>慢中子俘获（¹³C和²²Ne中子源）</td>\n<td>重元素（Ba, Sr, Zr）增丰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"行星状星云阶段\">行星状星云阶段</h3><p>AGB末期，超级风将外层包层几乎完全剥离（~0.1–0.2 M☉ 残留），暴露出炽热的碳-氧核心。核心的紫外辐射电离周围被抛射的气壳，形成行星状星云（Planetary Nebula）。中央星在数万年内冷却收缩，最终成为白矮星。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大质量恒星的演化轨迹\">大质量恒星的演化轨迹</h2><p>大质量恒星（M &gt; 8 M☉）的演化与低质量恒星有本质区别：</p>\n<h3 id=\"蓝超巨星-红超巨星的往复\">蓝超巨星 → 红超巨星的往复</h3><p>大质量恒星在HR图上经历复杂的蓝-红往复运动。离开主序后：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>向红方演化 → 红超巨星（RSG）</li>\n<li>在某些质量范围内可回到蓝方 → 蓝超巨星（BSG）</li>\n<li>质量损失和混合过程强烈影响轨迹的具体形状</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"沃尔夫-拉叶星-wolf-rayet-stars\">沃尔夫-拉叶星（Wolf-Rayet Stars）</h3><p>极大质量恒星（M &gt; 25 M☉）通过强烈的恒星风剥离富氢包层，暴露出富氦甚至富碳/氧的核心，成为 Wolf-Rayet 星。分类为 WN（富氮/氦）→ WC（富碳）→ WO（富氧），反映逐渐深入的剥离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大质量恒星的最终命运\">大质量恒星的最终命运</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[大质量恒星&lt;br/&gt;M &gt; 8 M☉] --&gt; B[核心多阶段燃烧&lt;br/&gt;H→He→C→Ne→O→Si→Fe]&#10;    B --&gt; C[铁核形成&lt;br/&gt;无法释放核能]&#10;    C --&gt; D[核心坍缩]&#10;    D --&gt; E{初始质量?}&#10;    E --&gt;|8-25 M☉| F[核坍缩超新星&lt;br/&gt;Type II/Ib/Ic]&#10;    E --&gt;|25-40 M☉| G[可能的黑洞&lt;br/&gt;通过回落]&#10;    E --&gt;|&gt;40 M☉| H[直接坍缩&lt;br/&gt;无超新星?]&#10;    F --&gt; I[中子星残骸]&#10;    G --&gt; J[恒星级黑洞]&#10;    H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[大质量恒星&lt;br/&gt;M &gt; 8 M☉] --&gt; B[核心多阶段燃烧&lt;br/&gt;H→He→C→Ne→O→Si→Fe]\n    B --&gt; C[铁核形成&lt;br/&gt;无法释放核能]\n    C --&gt; D[核心坍缩]\n    D --&gt; E{初始质量?}\n    E --&gt;|8-25 M☉| F[核坍缩超新星&lt;br/&gt;Type II/Ib/Ic]\n    E --&gt;|25-40 M☉| G[可能的黑洞&lt;br/&gt;通过回落]\n    E --&gt;|&gt;40 M☉| H[直接坍缩&lt;br/&gt;无超新星?]\n    F --&gt; I[中子星残骸]\n    G --&gt; J[恒星级黑洞]\n    H --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"恒星演化的质量分界\">恒星演化的质量分界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>初始质量范围</th>\n<th>演化终点</th>\n<th>关键过程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.08–0.5 M☉</td>\n<td>He白矮星</td>\n<td>不点燃He，直接形成He WD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5–8 M☉</td>\n<td>CO白矮星</td>\n<td>AGB → 行星状星云 → CO WD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8–10 M☉</td>\n<td>ONeMg白矮星或中子星</td>\n<td>电子俘获超新星边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–25 M☉</td>\n<td>中子星</td>\n<td>核坍缩超新星（II型/Ib/Ic）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25–40 M☉</td>\n<td>中子星或黑洞</td>\n<td>回落决定残骸类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 40 M☉</td>\n<td>黑洞</td>\n<td>可能直接坍缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>130–250 M☉</td>\n<td>无残骸</td>\n<td>对不稳定超新星（完全瓦解）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"等龄线与星团应用\">等龄线与星团应用</h2><p><strong>等龄线</strong>（Isochrone）是HR图上同一年龄、不同质量恒星的位置连线。通过将观测到的星团颜色-星等图（CMD）与理论等龄线拟合，可以确定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>星团年龄：主序拐点（Turn-off Point）位置</li>\n<li>星团距离：视差星等与绝对星等之差</li>\n<li>金属丰度：RGB斜率和颜色</li>\n<li>红化/消光：整体颜色偏移</li>\n</ul>\n<p>等龄线拟合是确定恒星族群年龄的最可靠方法之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最新观测进展\">最新观测进展</h2><h3 id=\"jwst-对恒星演化的新约束-2024-2026\">JWST 对恒星演化的新约束（2024–2026）</h3><p>James Webb 空间望远镜的高精度红外测光在以下方面推进了恒星演化研究：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次在远距离星系中分辨 AGB 热脉冲星的单个光变曲线</li>\n<li>对近邻矮星系中极低金属丰度恒星（[Fe/H] &lt; −3）的完整CMD测量</li>\n<li>红超巨星问题的新视角：RSG光度上限可能与对流包层中的超绝热温度梯度有关</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2026年恒星直接坍缩的首次观测\">2026年恒星直接坍缩的首次观测</h3><p>2026年2月，加州理工学院团队报告了M31-2014-DS1恒星直接坍缩形成黑洞的完整观测证据。这颗位于仙女座星系的大质量恒星自2014年起红外增亮，2016年亮度骤降，至2022-2023年在可见光和近红外波段基本消失。该观测首次直接证实了&quot;失败超新星&quot;（failed supernova）这一理论预测的恒星终结路径，表明并非所有大质量恒星都通过超新星爆发结束生命。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gaia-dr3-对恒星参数的系统测量\">Gaia DR3 对恒星参数的系统测量</h3><p>Gaia 数据释放第三版（DR3）提供了超过15亿颗恒星的精确视差、自行和测光数据，使HR图的统计研究达到前所未有的完整性。特别是发现了主序下方的&quot;亚矮星间隙&quot;以及白矮星冷却序列中的结晶化堆积等新结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>赫罗图把恒星一生的演化轨迹可视化为一条曲线：主序（核心 H 燃烧，停留最久）→ 亚巨星支 → 红巨星支 → 水平支/氦燃烧 → 渐近巨星支 → 行星状星云 → 白矮星；大质量恒星则走多阶段燃烧的蓝/红超巨星往复路线。</li>\n<li>主序寿命由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>3.5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\propto M^{3.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与燃料量共同决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{MS}\\propto M^{-2.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此 O 型星只有几百万年，而 M 型星寿命超过宇宙年龄。</li>\n<li>演化路径的关键分岔点是质量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M&lt;2M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 经历简并氦核的氦闪，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M&gt;8M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 走多阶段燃烧直至铁核，最终按初始质量落入中子星或黑洞（含 130–250 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的对不稳定超新星无残骸路径）。</li>\n<li>等龄线是把理论轨迹与观测星团颜色-星等图联系起来的桥梁，使星团年龄、距离、金属丰度估计成为可能。</li>\n<li>Gaia DR3 与 JWST 正把 HR 图的统计与个体研究推向新精度，而 M31-2014-DS1 等直接坍缩观测正在改写大质量恒星终态的经验图景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"恒星演化轨迹：赫罗图","id":"恒星演化轨迹-赫罗图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"赫罗图的基本概念","id":"赫罗图的基本概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HR图的主要区域","id":"hr图的主要区域"},{"level":2,"text":"主序阶段：核心氢燃烧","id":"主序阶段-核心氢燃烧"},{"level":3,"text":"零龄主序（ZAMS）","id":"零龄主序-zams"},{"level":3,"text":"主序寿命","id":"主序寿命"},{"level":3,"text":"主序内演化","id":"主序内演化"},{"level":2,"text":"离开主序：亚巨星支与红巨星支","id":"离开主序-亚巨星支与红巨星支"},{"level":3,"text":"薛恩